{"seq":3,"slug":"performance-engineering","title":"函数式编程的性能工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typed-functional-programming/practice/performance-engineering","wordCount":1153,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"函数式编程的性能工程\">函数式编程的性能工程</h1><p>「函数式编程很慢」是一个持续了数十年的迷思。不可变数据意味着频繁复制？高阶函数意味着间接调用开销？惰性求值意味着不可预测的内存使用？这些担忧有一定道理，但现代 FP 生态已经发展出系统性的解决方案。本文从持久化数据结构、尾递归优化、惰性求值控制、编译器优化到运行时工程五个维度，展示如何在保持不可变性和纯函数的同时获得可控的性能。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>FP 性能工程的核心认知：不可变性和纯函数带来的额外开销是可管理的，且通常被它们解锁的优化（编译器 fusion、并行化、缓存）所补偿。性能问题有系统化的诊断路径：内存压力 → 检查 thunk 累积和中间结构；CPU 瓶颈 → 检查数据结构选择和递归策略；GC 压力 → 检查分配频率和对象生命周期。关键工具是持久化数据结构（结构共享）、尾递归优化、stream fusion 和线性类型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"持久化数据结构-结构共享的魔法\">持久化数据结构：结构共享的魔法</h2><p>不可变数据结构的关键洞察：「修改」不需要完整复制。持久化数据结构（Persistent Data Structures）通过结构共享（Structural Sharing），让新旧版本共享未变化的部分。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    Root1[&quot;Root v1&quot;] --&gt; A[&quot;Node A&quot;]&#10;    Root1 --&gt; B[&quot;Node B&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;Leaf 1&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;Leaf 2&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; E[&quot;Leaf 3&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; F[&quot;Leaf 4&quot;]&#10;    Root2[&quot;Root v2 (更新 Leaf 2)&quot;] --&gt; A2[&quot;Node A&#39;&quot;]&#10;    Root2 --&gt; B&#10;    A2 --&gt; C&#10;    A2 --&gt; D2[&quot;Leaf 2&#39; (新值)&quot;]\">graph TD\n    Root1[\"Root v1\"] --&gt; A[\"Node A\"]\n    Root1 --&gt; B[\"Node B\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"Leaf 1\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"Leaf 2\"]\n    B --&gt; E[\"Leaf 3\"]\n    B --&gt; F[\"Leaf 4\"]\n    Root2[\"Root v2 (更新 Leaf 2)\"] --&gt; A2[\"Node A'\"]\n    Root2 --&gt; B\n    A2 --&gt; C\n    A2 --&gt; D2[\"Leaf 2' (新值)\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据结构</th>\n<th>查找</th>\n<th>插入</th>\n<th>删除</th>\n<th>空间共享</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>HAMTrie (Clojure Vector)</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>32</mn></msub><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log_{32} n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">32</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>32</mn></msub><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log_{32} n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">32</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>32</mn></msub><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log_{32} n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">32</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Red-Black Tree (Haskell Map)</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Finger Tree (Seq)</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> amortized</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> amortized</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cons List</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> head</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> head</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>HAMT（Hash Array Mapped Trie）是 2026 年使用最广泛的持久化数据结构——Clojure 的 vector/map、Scala 的 immutable.HashMap、JavaScript 的 Immer/Immutable.js 底层都采用此结构。32-way 分支使得树高极低（100 万元素只需 4 层），实际性能接近可变 HashMap。</p>\n<h2 id=\"尾递归与尾调用优化\">尾递归与尾调用优化</h2><p>递归是 FP 中循环的替代品。但朴素递归每次调用占用一个栈帧，深度过大会栈溢出。尾递归优化（Tail Call Optimization, TCO）将尾位置的递归调用转换为循环，消除栈帧累积。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"scala\" data-code=\"// 非尾递归：每次调用增加栈帧&#10;def factorial(n: Long): Long =&#10;  if n &lt;= 1 then 1&#10;  else n * factorial(n - 1)  // 递归调用不在尾位置&#10;&#10;// 尾递归：编译器转为循环&#10;@tailrec&#10;def factorial(n: Long, acc: Long = 1): Long =&#10;  if n &lt;= 1 then acc&#10;  else factorial(n - 1, n * acc)  // 尾位置，可优化\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 非尾递归：每次调用增加栈帧</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>def factorial(n: Long): Long =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if n &#x3C;= 1 then 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  else n * factorial(n - 1)  // 递归调用不在尾位置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 尾递归：编译器转为循环</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@tailrec</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>def factorial(n: Long, acc: Long = 1): Long =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if n &#x3C;= 1 then acc</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  else factorial(n - 1, n * acc)  // 尾位置，可优化</span></span></code></pre></div><p>各语言的 TCO 支持：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>语言</th>\n<th>TCO 支持</th>\n<th>备注</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Haskell</td>\n<td>完整</td>\n<td>惰性求值使尾递归问题更微妙</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Scala</td>\n<td><code>@tailrec</code> 注解保证</td>\n<td>编译时验证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Erlang/Elixir</td>\n<td>完整</td>\n<td>BEAM VM 原生支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rust</td>\n<td>有限</td>\n<td>依赖 LLVM 优化，不保证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TypeScript/JS</td>\n<td>仅 Safari</td>\n<td>V8 未实现 proper TCO</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Kotlin</td>\n<td><code>tailrec</code> 关键字</td>\n<td>编译时验证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Java</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>JVM 不支持；Loom 虚拟线程减轻影响</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>对于不支持 TCO 的语言，常用替代方案：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Trampoline</strong>：将递归转为循环执行的惰性 thunk 链</li>\n<li><strong>CPS 变换</strong>：Continuation-Passing Style 消除栈增长</li>\n<li><strong>手动改写为循环</strong>：务实但丧失表达力</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"惰性求值的性能特征\">惰性求值的性能特征</h2><p>Haskell 的惰性求值（Lazy Evaluation）带来独特的性能特征：</p>\n<p>优势：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>避免计算不需要的值</li>\n<li>自然支持无限数据结构</li>\n<li>编译器可以进行更激进的优化（短路、fusion）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>代价：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Thunk（延迟计算的闭包）占用堆内存</li>\n<li>Thunk 累积可能导致空间泄漏（space leak）</li>\n<li>性能分析比严格求值更困难</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"haskell\" data-code=\"-- 空间泄漏示例&#10;-- foldl 累积 thunk 而非立即求值&#10;badSum = foldl (+) 0 [1..1000000]&#10;-- 内存中：((((0 + 1) + 2) + 3) + ...) 百万层 thunk&#10;&#10;-- 修复：使用严格版本&#10;goodSum = foldl&#39; (+) 0 [1..1000000]&#10;-- foldl&#39; 每步强制求值，常量内存\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- 空间泄漏示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- foldl 累积 thunk 而非立即求值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>badSum = foldl (+) 0 [1..1000000]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 内存中：((((0 + 1) + 2) + 3) + ...) 百万层 thunk</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 修复：使用严格版本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>goodSum = foldl' (+) 0 [1..1000000]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- foldl' 每步强制求值，常量内存</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"stream-fusion-消除中间数据结构\">Stream Fusion：消除中间数据结构</h2><p>函数式代码常写成链式变换：<code>list.map(f).filter(g).map(h)</code>。朴素实现每步创建中间列表。Stream Fusion（流融合）/ Deforestation（森林消除）将多步变换融合为单次遍历。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"haskell\" data-code=\"-- GHC 的 rewrite rules 自动进行 fusion&#10;-- 源代码（逻辑清晰）&#10;result = sum . map (*2) . filter even $ [1..1000]&#10;&#10;-- 编译后（单次遍历，无中间列表）&#10;-- 等效于手写循环：遍历一次，遇 even 则 *2 并累加\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- GHC 的 rewrite rules 自动进行 fusion</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 源代码（逻辑清晰）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>result = sum . map (*2) . filter even $ [1..1000]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 编译后（单次遍历，无中间列表）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 等效于手写循环：遍历一次，遇 even 则 *2 并累加</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Rust 的 Iterator trait、Java Stream API、Scala LazyList 都实现了类似的惰性 fusion 机制——变换只在最终 <code>collect()</code>/<code>toList</code> 时触发，中间不分配。</p>\n<h2 id=\"effect-ts-v4-的性能优化\">Effect-TS v4 的性能优化</h2><p>Effect-TS v4（2026 年 beta）对运行时做了重大性能改进：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Fiber 运行时完全重写：更低内存开销、更快执行</li>\n<li>Bundle size 从 v3 的 ~70KB 降到 ~20KB（含 Stream + Schema）</li>\n<li>核心模块重建以性能为首要目标</li>\n<li>积极的 tree-shaking 支持</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这让 TypeScript 开发者能在不牺牲性能的前提下使用 Effect System。</p>\n<h2 id=\"性能优化决策矩阵\">性能优化决策矩阵</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    Start[&quot;性能瓶颈?&quot;]&#10;    Start --&gt;|&quot;内存&quot;| Mem[&quot;检查 thunk/中间结构&quot;]&#10;    Start --&gt;|&quot;CPU&quot;| CPU[&quot;检查算法复杂度&quot;]&#10;    Start --&gt;|&quot;GC 压力&quot;| GC[&quot;检查分配频率&quot;]&#10;    Mem --&gt; M1[&quot;用 strict 版本消除 thunk&quot;]&#10;    Mem --&gt; M2[&quot;用 fusion 消除中间列表&quot;]&#10;    CPU --&gt; C1[&quot;用持久化数据结构替代复制&quot;]&#10;    CPU --&gt; C2[&quot;用尾递归/trampoline&quot;]&#10;    GC --&gt; G1[&quot;用 linear types 控制分配&quot;]&#10;    GC --&gt; G2[&quot;用 mutable buffer 做局部优化&quot;]\">graph TD\n    Start[\"性能瓶颈?\"]\n    Start --&gt;|\"内存\"| Mem[\"检查 thunk/中间结构\"]\n    Start --&gt;|\"CPU\"| CPU[\"检查算法复杂度\"]\n    Start --&gt;|\"GC 压力\"| GC[\"检查分配频率\"]\n    Mem --&gt; M1[\"用 strict 版本消除 thunk\"]\n    Mem --&gt; M2[\"用 fusion 消除中间列表\"]\n    CPU --&gt; C1[\"用持久化数据结构替代复制\"]\n    CPU --&gt; C2[\"用尾递归/trampoline\"]\n    GC --&gt; G1[\"用 linear types 控制分配\"]\n    GC --&gt; G2[\"用 mutable buffer 做局部优化\"]</pre><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>持久化数据结构通过结构共享实现不可变 + 高效更新</li>\n<li>尾递归优化消除栈帧累积；不支持的语言用 trampoline 替代</li>\n<li>惰性求值节省不必要的计算，但需警惕空间泄漏</li>\n<li>Stream Fusion 将多步变换合并为单次遍历</li>\n<li>性能问题有系统化的诊断路径，不必放弃 FP 原则</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"../foundations/higher-order-functions\">高阶函数与闭包</a> — map/filter/fold 链是 fusion 优化的对象</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../haskell-pure-functional/practice/performance-evaluation\">Haskell hub：性能与求值</a> — Haskell 惰性求值的完整性能工程实践</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"函数式编程的性能工程","id":"函数式编程的性能工程"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"持久化数据结构：结构共享的魔法","id":"持久化数据结构-结构共享的魔法"},{"level":2,"text":"尾递归与尾调用优化","id":"尾递归与尾调用优化"},{"level":2,"text":"惰性求值的性能特征","id":"惰性求值的性能特征"},{"level":2,"text":"Stream Fusion：消除中间数据结构","id":"stream-fusion-消除中间数据结构"},{"level":2,"text":"Effect-TS v4 的性能优化","id":"effect-ts-v4-的性能优化"},{"level":2,"text":"性能优化决策矩阵","id":"性能优化决策矩阵"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"Property-Based Testing 与函数式测试策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typed-functional-programming/practice/property-based-testing"},"next":null}